{"data":[{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2024-07-21T03:30:36.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1814865533055214056"],"id":"1814865533055214056","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":14,"impression_count":85555,"like_count":63,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":16,"retweet_count":3},"text":"发了一个小红书，本来是抱着多余的票别浪费的心态，结果瞬间就有一大堆人跑来私信我跟我要票，还有的直接把地址发给我让我寄给他？？？？？？？\n你们都不把文章看完吗？？？ https://t.co/ajvXkbiAiG","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1814865533055214056"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2024-07-19T23:51:11.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1814447926057546100"],"id":"1814447926057546100","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":105,"impression_count":186373,"like_count":235,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":22,"retweet_count":15},"text":"最近不知咋了有好多福利姬找我想来日本接单的，本身我就不太喜欢安排这种，只有那种看起来有点市场的女孩子，我才会帮忙去安排几单试试。而且我必须要统一说明一下，中国女孩子来日本的日本客单价普遍偏低。 https://t.co/35HUsLIKQT","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1814447926057546100"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2024-07-18T11:06:01.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1813892981449228652"],"id":"1813892981449228652","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":30,"impression_count":79214,"like_count":73,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":4,"retweet_count":5},"text":"邀请了一个我喜欢的旅游博主跟我一路玩到北海道，顺路帮他拍几期视频😆拍摄计划做好了剩下的就看能不能成行了😉\n日本所有有流量的东西我都知道😂 https://t.co/GYH89MtbX1","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1813892981449228652"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2024-07-17T14:32:04.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1813582445423587423"],"id":"1813582445423587423","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":95,"impression_count":129473,"like_count":530,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":17,"retweet_count":11},"text":"又找到一家好玩的店... https://t.co/UGuWsIHSW2","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1813582445423587423"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2024-07-16T12:32:48.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1813190042791387438"],"id":"1813190042791387438","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":154,"impression_count":522857,"like_count":776,"quote_count":25,"reply_count":139,"retweet_count":44},"text":"刚刚陪一个公司客户吃饭，\n他跟我说知道国内怎样睡女孩子最简单吗？\n就是装成帮女权发声，帮她们去骂男人。\n然后她们就会感觉你是一伙的，\n稍微私下共情几句她们就能免费睡了，\n最后还来了一句，\n国内女权基本都是脑子不咋够用的一群人...\n多年不回国，国内都这样了吗...\n我瞳孔地震...😳","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1813190042791387438"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2024-07-14T04:27:10.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1812343054050996430"],"id":"1812343054050996430","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":14,"impression_count":93844,"like_count":74,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":11,"retweet_count":7},"text":"日本的高级中餐厅到底有多坑人，我是真的服了能把中餐做成这逼样也是个狠人...\n问题这还是日本排名前三的中餐，日本人真的是山猪没吃过细糠啊... https://t.co/tIv8GObi4C","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1812343054050996430"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2024-07-14T03:12:53.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1812324359446671386"],"id":"1812324359446671386","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":101,"impression_count":295138,"like_count":290,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":84,"retweet_count":15},"text":"日本外围线下素人这种女孩子真的是多到数不过来，好多都是一边兼着模特coser一边线下接客人。\n每天我这边都能接到一堆模卡，我挑几个见过本人的发飞机频道，剩下的全由东京客服整理发给客人...\n最主要还是她们的日本客人已经严重饱和，没有中国客户她们根本没钱去赚...🙃 https://t.co/VtwlUBgnlV","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1812324359446671386"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2024-07-12T05:21:56.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1811632062149116015"],"id":"1811632062149116015","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":4,"impression_count":73623,"like_count":47,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":4,"retweet_count":2},"text":"我好像确实有些幸存者偏差了，\n因为我这边会员基本都是高知人群，\n来的客户也都是高素质高颜值高智商的偏多，\n我跟那帮接小团的私导聊完他们安排过的奇葩客人才知道，\n原来来日本风俗的还有那么多又油又土还又不懂规矩的奇葩大哥...😂","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1811632062149116015"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2024-07-11T15:10:46.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1811417859123503216"],"id":"1811417859123503216","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":29,"impression_count":120739,"like_count":132,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":18,"retweet_count":4},"text":"今天刚酒店安排完深田，\n碰到一个华人中介带一个长得特像深田的中国妹子，而且还不断跟那个妹子嘱咐，如果客人看出来就赶紧走就行...\n一天见到真假深田，也算是TM名场面了...😂 https://t.co/LJ0oBbKdGa","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1811417859123503216"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2024-07-11T13:11:23.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1811387813272952902"],"id":"1811387813272952902","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":290,"impression_count":205721,"like_count":907,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":20,"retweet_count":50},"text":"东京这家温泉泳池陪酒店真心适合那种商务接待局，\n会员群里的会员直接找东京客服可以帮你们安排。提前一天预定就可以😍😍😍 https://t.co/jymls3yPLL","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1811387813272952902"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2024-07-11T08:30:45.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1811317190282359160"],"id":"1811317190282359160","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":138,"impression_count":126500,"like_count":446,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":16,"retweet_count":20},"text":"哈哈哈哈，这家店太有意思了，最后泳池里直接有床的😂😂你们可以联系客服预约起来了，想不到六本木附近这么多好玩的店!! https://t.co/73VKm0tFY1","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1811317190282359160"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2024-07-11T08:18:37.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1811314139018694684"],"id":"1811314139018694684","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":111,"impression_count":138332,"like_count":613,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":21,"retweet_count":18},"text":"这个店，太太太尼玛炸了，等我玩完给你们写一下 https://t.co/iPrM14BaKh","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1811314139018694684"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2024-07-10T03:02:50.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1810872281243209972"],"id":"1810872281243209972","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":20,"impression_count":93079,"like_count":71,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":17,"retweet_count":3},"text":"关于我的真实工作...😂 https://t.co/QccClJhhNG","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1810872281243209972"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2024-07-09T05:44:02.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1810550457812898006"],"id":"1810550457812898006","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":12,"impression_count":103828,"like_count":56,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":17,"retweet_count":2},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"1810503856507531412",